{"num":567,"id":"2021-079","year":"2021","num0":"079","stars":3,"univ":"신슈대학교","track":"의학부","subj":"미적분","text":"1 (1) ∫  x4 (1 − x)4 dx를 구하여라. 0 1 x4 (1 − x)4 (2) ∫ dx를 구하여라. 1 + x2   0 1 22 1 (3) < −π ","qimg":["p/jp/2021-079-q0.webp"],"simg":["p/jp/2021-079-s0.webp"],"ja":[{"p":"(1) $\\displaystyle\\int_0^1x^4(1-x)^4\\,dx$ を求めよ。"},{"p":"(2) $\\displaystyle\\int_0^1\\frac{x^4(1-x)^4}{1+x^2}\\,dx$ を求めよ。"},{"p":"(3) $\\dfrac1{1260}<\\dfrac{22}7-\\pi<\\dfrac1{630}$ を示せ。"}],"sim":{"ja":[{"p":"(1) $\\displaystyle\\int_0^1x^2(1-x)^2\\,dx$ を求めよ。"},{"p":"(2) $\\displaystyle\\int_0^1\\frac{x^2(1-x)^2}{1+x^2}\\,dx$ を求めよ。"},{"p":"(3) $\\dfrac23+\\dfrac1{60}<\\log2<\\dfrac23+\\dfrac1{30}$ を示せ。"}],"ans":{"ja":"(1) $\\dfrac1{30}$　(2) $\\log2-\\dfrac23$"},"sol":{"ja":[{"p":"(1) $\\displaystyle\\int_0^1(x^2-2x^3+x^4)dx=\\frac13-\\frac12+\\frac15=\\frac1{30}$。"},{"p":"(2) $x^4-2x^3+x^2=(x^2+1)(x^2-2x)+2x$ なので被積分関数は $x^2-2x+\\dfrac{2x}{1+x^2}$。積分して $\\dfrac13-1+\\Big[\\log(1+x^2)\\Big]_0^1=\\log2-\\dfrac23$。"},{"p":"(3) $0<x<1$ で $\\dfrac12<\\dfrac1{1+x^2}<1$ なので、$x^2(1-x)^2$ をかけて積分すると $\\dfrac12\\cdot\\dfrac1{30}<\\log2-\\dfrac23<\\dfrac1{30}$。"}]}},"art":""}